# 命令清单 — Phase 1.1.0（复现用）

> 全部在工作区根目录 `~/Code_New/MyGoExplorer` 执行，除非另行 `cd`。
> 完整输出见同目录 `01-…10-*.log`、`final-verify.log`。

## 0. 仓库基线

```sh
git init -b main
git add -A && git commit -m "chore(repo): initialize repository with phase 0 baseline"
```

## 1.1.1 决策落库

```sh
$EDITOR docs/DECISIONS.md
git add docs/DECISIONS.md TODO.md && git commit -m "docs(decisions): ..."
```

## 1.1.2 初始化 app 模块

```sh
export PATH="$HOME/go/bin:$PATH"
mygo init -template native -name "MyGo Explorer" \
  -module github.com/VrianCao/mygo-explorer/app app
cd app && go version          # go version go1.27.3 darwin/arm64
go test ./...                 # ok
```

## 1.1.3 锁定依赖

```sh
cd app
go mod tidy && git diff --exit-code -- go.mod go.sum
go list -m github.com/egoist/mygo     # github.com/egoist/mygo v0.7.1
go tool mygo version                  # mygo 0.7.1
go env GOVERSION GOROOT               # go1.27.3 / ...toolchain@v0.0.1-go1.27.3.darwin-arm64
```

## 1.1.4 mygo.json 与构建

```sh
cd app
cat mygo.json                 # name/identifier/version/out
go tool mygo build            # build/darwin-arm64/MyGo Explorer.app + dmg
plutil -p "build/darwin-arm64/MyGo Explorer.app/Contents/Info.plist" \
  | grep -E 'CFBundle(Name|Identifier|ShortVersionString)'
```

## 1.1.5 仓库卫生

```sh
git check-ignore -v reference/mygo/go.mod app/build/x app/.mygo/x certs/x.p12 \
  mygo-update.key docs/evidence/phase-1.1.0/x.tmp .DS_Store
git ls-files | grep -E '(\.p12$|mygo-update\.key$|\.DS_Store$|/build/|/\.mygo/)'  # 空
```

## 1.1.6 公开仓库

```sh
gh repo create VrianCao/mygo-explorer --public --source . --remote origin --push \
  --description "Native desktop gallery built with MyGo: ..."
gh repo edit VrianCao/mygo-explorer --add-topic go,native-ui,mygo,gallery
gh repo view VrianCao/mygo-explorer --json visibility -q .visibility   # PUBLIC
curl -sS -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://github.com/VrianCao/mygo-explorer  # 200
```

## 1.1.7 CI

```sh
git add .github/workflows/ci.yml && git commit -m "ci: ..." && git push origin main
gh run list --limit 1
gh run view <run-id> --json status,conclusion,jobs
gh run download <run-id> -D /tmp/mge-ci-artifacts
```

## 1.1.8 本地门禁

```sh
cd app && ./scripts/check.sh              # CHECK PASSED, exit 0
# 自测：改坏 main_test.go 的断言 → exit 1；git checkout -- main_test.go → 再次 PASS
```

## 1.1.9 README 与 tag

```sh
# 链接检查：本地链接存在 + 外链 curl 200（见 09-readme-tag.log）
git add -A && git commit -m "docs(readme): ... "
git tag -a v0.1.0 -m "MyGo Explorer v0.1.0 — Phase 1.1.0 baseline"
git push origin main v0.1.0
git tag -n1 && git ls-remote --tags origin
```

## 1.1.10 冒烟

```sh
cd app && go tool mygo dev                # 窗口标题 MyGo Explorer
# 截图：screencapture -x -o -l<window-id> docs/evidence/phase-1.1.0/smoke.png
# Ctrl+C（SIGINT）后：pgrep -fl 'MyGo Explorer|mygo dev'  # 无结果
```

## Phase 验收

```sh
cd app && ./scripts/check.sh
cd app && go test ./... && go tool mygo vet .
gh repo view VrianCao/mygo-explorer --json visibility -q .visibility
git log --oneline && git tag -n1 && git status --short
```
